	(label "VLED"
		(at 40.64 81.28 270)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify right bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ea5bbfd7-ce65-5106-841d-dd3afc707d0b")
	)
	(text "POWER: USB-C breakout on the back wall (5.1k CC pull-downs on it) -> J1 JST-SH: VBUS / D- / D+ / GND.\nVBUS 5 V feeds the amp, the blower and (through D2) the LEDs. U1 AP2112K-3.3 LDO -> 3V3 for the\nmodule, mic and PIR. Budget ~150-250 mA typical, ~870 mA if everything peaks: firmware staggers\nspeech, Wi-Fi and fan. No battery."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 10.16 7.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e80982ab-37fb-52e3-80f2-1c2029a48014")
	)
	(text "MCU: ESP32-S3-WROOM-1-N16R8 on the board's back, antenna on the top edge (copper-free).\nNative USB on IO19/IO20 for flashing (no buttons needed). Pins picked for the layout: IO15 PIR\n(level with the PIR's OUT leg), IO16 LEDs, IO4/5/18 amp BCLK/LRCLK/DIN, IO8 amp SD,\nIO9/10/11 mic SCK/WS/SD, IO12 fan PWM. IO35-37 belong to the octal PSRAM."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 10.16 116.84 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f486311c-a1d3-5a89-b26e-e763fe484c30")
	)
	(text "SENSORS: AM312 PIR on an RC-filtered supply (R3/C8). ICS-43434 mic on the back, port over a\n1 mm hole through the board, rubber boot to the face's mic port. L/R low = left slot."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 203.2 7.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "97b85369-f1d4-5798-bf55-723cd2960f54")
	)
	(text "EYES: 2 x WS2812B-2020 on VLED = VBUS - one diode (~4.3 V), so their 0.7 x VDD input high\n(~3.0 V) accepts 3.3 V data with no level shifter. Lit only when a reminder needs attention."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 203.2 91.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5f228f3b-5aa2-541e-8cc3-2b4de368351b")
	)
	(text "SOUND + BREEZE: MAX98357A on 5 V (~1 W into 8 ohm), SD high = on / left, R6 keeps it off at boot.\nBlower: Q1 AO3400A low side at ~25 kHz PWM, D1 flyback, R8 keeps it off at boot."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 203.2 157.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a6528c61-98a4-5521-aa75-96047a070819")
	)
